---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What does Finnish Sauna Builders sell?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Its current catalog includes indoor and outdoor saunas, pre-cut room packages, custom saunas, electric and wood-burning heaters, controls, sauna wood, doors, benches, accessories, and selected cold-plunge and steam products. The brands and configurations vary by category and can change.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How does Finnish Sauna Builders deliver large saunas?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Its current shipping policy describes crated freight routed through a terminal and scheduled curbside delivery, generally with liftgate service. Large crates, restricted roads, remote locations, storage delays, and offloading needs can create additional work or charges, so confirm the exact shipment before ordering.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Can a Finnish Sauna Builders order be returned?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'The current policy says unused products may be returned within 30 days, with return shipping deducted, while used or installed products cannot be returned and custom-made products are non-returnable. Cancellation fees and brand-specific terms can apply. Read the live policy and written order terms before paying.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Is Finnish Sauna Builders better than buying direct?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'That cannot be decided from the retailer name alone. Compare the exact configuration, written total price, freight and offload, lead time, cancellation and return terms, manufacturer warranty, damage process, installation responsibility, and local service path on the same date.',
      },
    },
  ],
};
---
<Base
  title="Finnish Sauna Builders Review: Catalog, Delivery, and Buyer Checks"
  description="Review Finnish Sauna Builders by current catalog, quote scope, freight delivery, cancellation and return limits, damage reporting, warranty path, and buyer fit."
  canonical="/brands/finnish-sauna-builders-review"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-amber-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Retailer due diligence</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-4">Finnish Sauna Builders: compare the written project, not the storefront</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 mb-3">The catalog is broad enough to support several buying paths. The useful question is whether one exact room, heater, freight plan, warranty path, and local installation scope fit your address.</p>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm">Reviewed August 16, 2026 &mdash; Backyard Sauna Pro</p>
    </header>

    <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3">
      <img src="/images/lifestyle/sauna-interior-forest-view.jpg" alt="Wood sauna interior used to illustrate a dealer-planned sauna project" class="w-full object-cover max-h-80" loading="eager" width="1200" height="800" />
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">Illustrative sauna interior; not a Finnish Sauna Builders showroom or documented customer installation.</p>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Commercial boundary:</strong> We did not buy from, install with, or independently test Finnish Sauna Builders. Direct retailer links on this page are not presented as commission-bearing links. Recheck the current catalog and policies before ordering.
    </div>

    <section class="bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-300 mb-2">Short answer</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Useful when you want one retailer to quote several parts of the project.</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-200 mb-5">The current store spans complete saunas, custom rooms, heaters, controls, wood, doors, benches, and accessories. That breadth can simplify comparison. It does not replace model-level sizing, local trade review, or careful freight and policy checks.</p>
      <a href="https://finnishsaunabuilders.com/collections" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-amber-400 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900 hover:bg-amber-500" data-track-event="brand_outbound_click" data-partner="finnish_sauna_builders" data-cta-position="finnish_builders_above_fold">See the current catalog</a>
    </section>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="finnish_builders_after_verdict"
      heading="Prepare the project before requesting a quote"
      description="Capture the room or site, dimensions, heat preference, electrical status, delivery access, budget, ZIP code, timeline, and installation needs. Your answers stay in your browser unless you explicitly submit them for manual review."
    />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">What the current catalog can cover</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-stone-200 rounded-lg mb-8">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] text-sm text-left">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 text-stone-900">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Buying path</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Current catalog evidence</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Verify in the quote</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-200 text-stone-700">
          <tr class="align-top"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Complete sauna</th><td class="px-4 py-3">Indoor, outdoor, barrel, luxury, commercial, and size-based collections are listed.</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Exact model, heater package, controls, materials, dimensions, freight, assembly, warranty, and exclusions.</td></tr>
          <tr class="align-top"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Room or custom build</th><td class="px-4 py-3">Pre-cut room packages, wall and bench boards, custom saunas, and installation services appear in the catalog.</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Design responsibility, drawings, field measurements, floor, ventilation, utilities, permits, labor, schedule, and change-order terms.</td></tr>
          <tr class="align-top"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Heater and controls</th><td class="px-4 py-3">Current collections include electric and wood-burning heaters, controls, stones, guards, and several manufacturer lines.</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Room calculation, item number, voltage and phase, controls, stones, guard, clearances, listing documents, electrician or chimney scope, and local acceptance.</td></tr>
          <tr class="align-top"><th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Parts and accessories</th><td class="px-4 py-3">Doors, windows, flooring, lighting, benches, backrests, vents, buckets, and other accessories are listed.</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Compatibility with the exact room and heater, quantity, finish, mounting, heat and moisture limits, return eligibility, and replacement availability.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">The freight handoff deserves its own plan</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">The current shipping policy describes made-to-order saunas and hot tubs arriving as crated prefabricated kits. Lead times are provided during checkout and confirmed after the order. Shipping cost depends on the product and destination.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">The policy describes freight-terminal routing and scheduled curbside delivery. It also identifies situations that may require extra charges or buyer-arranged offloading, including restricted roads, remote locations, large crates, or delayed receipt. Before ordering, get the crate dimensions, weight, truck requirements, liftgate limits, storage risk, and route from curb to build site in writing.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-10">
      <section class="border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 bg-white">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">At delivery</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li>Confirm the number of crates and boxes.</li>
          <li>Inspect visible damage before signing.</li>
          <li>Write shortages or visible damage on the delivery receipt.</li>
          <li>Open and inspect promptly for concealed damage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-5 bg-white">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">After delivery</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700">The current policy requires concealed damage or missing items to be reported within 72 hours. Confirm the exact reporting channel, photos, packaging retention, manufacturer claim process, replacement timing, and who pays for labor or equipment needed to correct a problem.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Read the cancellation and return terms before paying</h2>
    <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-600 bg-amber-50 p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <p class="mb-3"><strong>The current policy is restrictive after commitment.</strong> It describes a short cancellation window, possible processing and restocking fees, non-returnable custom products, no returns for used or installed products, and buyer-paid return shipping for eligible unused products.</p>
      <p>Policies can change and brand-specific terms may apply. Save the version shown when ordering and ask the retailer to resolve conflicts between the product page, checkout, manufacturer warranty, and general policy in writing.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Use the same quote screen for every seller</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Configuration:</strong> item numbers, room materials, benches, door, windows, roof, floor, heater, controls, stones, guards, lights, vents, and accessories.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Site and utilities:</strong> foundation or finished floor, drainage, weather work, electrical or chimney scope, permits, inspections, ventilation, and service clearances.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Delivery:</strong> lead time, freight cost, crate dimensions and weight, truck access, liftgate, curbside limit, offload, storage, inspection, and damage reporting.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-stone-900">Labor:</strong> assembly, installation, licensed trades, commissioning, travel, cleanup, and every excluded task.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-stone-900">After-sale terms:</strong> cancellation, returns, restocking, manufacturer warranty, retailer claim role, replacement parts, service availability, and labor exclusions.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Primary sources checked</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><a href="https://finnishsaunabuilders.com/collections" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Finnish Sauna Builders: current collections and product categories</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://finnishsaunabuilders.com/pages/shipping-delivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Finnish Sauna Builders: current shipping and delivery policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://finnishsaunabuilders.com/pages/refund-cancellation-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Finnish Sauna Builders: current refund and cancellation policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://finnishsaunabuilders.com/pages/warranty-replacement" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Finnish Sauna Builders: current damage and warranty process</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">What does Finnish Sauna Builders sell?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">The current catalog spans complete saunas, room packages, custom projects, heaters, controls, wood, doors, benches, accessories, and related wellness equipment. Verify the exact current category and product.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">How are large saunas delivered?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">The current policy describes crated freight with scheduled curbside delivery and model-specific offloading requirements. Confirm the shipment and site route in writing.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Can an order be returned?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">Some unused products may qualify under the current policy. Installed, used, or custom-made products face stricter limits. Cancellation, restocking, processing, and return-shipping terms can apply.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Is this retailer better than buying direct?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">There is no universal answer. Compare the exact product, complete installed scope, delivery, policies, warranty path, service, and current total on the same date.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Continue comparing</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-kits/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Compare complete sauna-kit scopes</a></li>
        <li><a href="/brands/huum-sauna-heater-review/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Review HUUM heater requirements</a></li>
        <li><a href="/brands/almost-heaven-sauna-review/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Review Almost Heaven room options</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-cost/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Build a complete project budget</a></li>
        <li><a href="/how-we-review/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Read our research method</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
